1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,663
A tenant asks for every receipt of the
year so far.

2
00:00:03,663 --> 00:00:06,328
Open the tenancy contract, then its
Cheques tab.

3
00:00:06,328 --> 00:00:09,991
In the cheque grid, every cleared cheque
has a tick box.

4
00:00:09,991 --> 00:00:12,656
Tick the rent for January, February and
March.

5
00:00:12,656 --> 00:00:15,653
The button counts what you ticked:
Combined receipt, three.

6
00:00:15,653 --> 00:00:19,650
Select it, and one PDF downloads, with one
receipt on each page:

7
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:23,313
the amount received, the cheque number,
and the date it cleared.

8
00:00:23,313 --> 00:00:25,644
For a whole year, use Select year.

9
00:00:25,644 --> 00:00:29,308
Pick twenty twenty-six, and every payment
that cleared that year is

10
00:00:29,308 --> 00:00:32,638
ticked at once: eleven of them, the
security deposit included.

11
00:00:32,638 --> 00:00:35,969
Download, and the year's receipts arrive
as a single file.

12
00:00:35,969 --> 00:00:37,967
Only cleared cheques can be ticked.

13
00:00:37,967 --> 00:00:40,964
A cheque that has not been banked yet has

14
00:00:40,964 --> 00:00:43,629
no receipt, so it has no tick box.

15
00:00:43,629 --> 00:00:46,959
One download covers one contract, up to a
hundred receipts.

16
00:00:46,959 --> 00:00:48,624
Tenants can do this themselves.

17
00:00:48,624 --> 00:00:51,289
In the tenant portal, Rajesh opens My
Payments.

18
00:00:51,289 --> 00:00:53,953
Above his payment history is the same bar.

19
00:00:53,953 --> 00:00:57,616
He ticks the two receipts he needs, and
selects Download receipts.

20
00:00:57,616 --> 00:00:59,948
Or he picks a year, and the

21
00:00:59,948 --> 00:01:01,946
whole year downloads in one go.

22
00:01:01,946 --> 00:01:04,943
A tenant with more than one contract first
chooses

23
00:01:04,943 --> 00:01:07,608
the contract, so a renewal on the same

24
00:01:07,608 --> 00:01:10,272
unit is never mixed with the old one.
